motif (2.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Package Motif 2.5.0: libxm5, libmrm5, libuil5, libmotif-common,
    libmotif-dev, mwm and uil.  The SONAMEs are libXm.so.5, libMrm.so.5
    and libUil.so.5; programs built against Motif 2.3 (libXm.so.4) must
    be rebuilt.

